      "instructions": "Print only supplied Traditional Chinese artwork text for Taiwan. Professional operational wording: explicit reconciliation objects, responsibility and practical next step. Use separately reviewed Taiwan terms; never convert mainland copy mechanically or assume national personality. No audit, vendor qualification or commercial guarantees. Keep original scene and narrative order. Preserve Traditional Chinese glyphs and exact supplied punctuation. Never mix scripts or use pseudo-Chinese. Use ASCII parentheses for approved acronym definitions to remain compatible with the frozen gate; do not normalize other punctuation. Review Taiwan punctuation placement, Chinese line starts/ends and mixed Latin terms at 333px; reduce scene area before shrinking type. B13v5 bright white/blue photographic campaign family. Reference wording is not approved copy. Official supplied logo once; no extra DIGIWIN header. Exact category/sequence near logo. Body comfortably readable at333CSSpx. Source normal full-width main paragraph on white, at least body-sized. All paper blank; no bars/rules/charts/ticks/data glyphs/UI/customer geography/seal/badge. Only approved artwork words. Demand-change questions are not forecast accuracy or automatic replanning claims. Reduce scene before type. TARGETED SOURCE HIERARCHY EDIT ONLY. Reference1 is the actual defective target. Preserve exact approved Traditional headline/body/category/3/4 and logo once, exact original Simplified legal entity 上海晶丰明源半导体股份有限公司. ENLARGE both publisher and full legal-name source to at least body glyph height; full legal name MUST be 56px or more on1254canvas and use whole1120px text width. Put source on TWO full-width plain-white large paragraph lines below a much smaller scene; reserve bottom200px. Reduce scene to fit, never shrink legal name. Keep entire source visible and at least as large as body. No skyline/divider/icon/source box/ticks/data/new text/claims. Do not change any legal-name glyph to Traditional. Do not revert headline to 来自中国的."
